  Quote of the Week:

  Desierius Erasmus, Dutch scholar, 1521:
  "Let a King recall that to improve his realm is better than to increase 
his territory."


ACTION REPORT    

Here's what happened to Your Majesty this turn:


  With the advent of the spring season Giovanna set out to quench her thirst 
for glory.  Hakim cast a Phantasmal Armies spell and illusory armies were 
formed for Giovanna.
  Tiffany cast a spell giving magical powers of oratory to Giovanna.
  Bairn cast a Phantasmal Armies spell and illusory armies were formed for 
Giovanna.  Bairn's efforts raised his prowess in Illusions.
  Isis tried an Oratory spell, but botched it.  Giovanna moved into Rejaf 
(#1503) with her redoubtable army.  Rejaf had an illusion cast upon it.  It 
was actually a Desert province.

  Giovanna ordered an invasion force into the adjacent Desert province of 
Rejaf, owned by Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll (#1).  Giovanna commanded 
the invading armies.  The defenders were led by Guerin (#18).  The armies 
were drawn up into lines of battle as shown here:

